Sorry to have been abbreviated: I should have been explicit in saying "refe=
rs to the object that fills the first place in this instance of the relatio=
n" or some such thing.

I have no idea why selpa'i picked his name (and I doubt you do), indeed, I =
didn't bother thinking about what it meant until this discussion go started=
 and then I assumed he picked it because his name was "David" or some such =
thing.=A0 But whatever it is, it is clearly irrelevant to the name as a nam=
e and so is, at best, a direction to follow in a psychological inquiry, har=
dly a claim about how names from predicates work.=A0=20




